   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4fbf7211",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "# Soal 1 — Eksplorasi Data `users_data_cleaned.pickle`\n",
    "Diberikan dataset users_data_cleaned.pickle. Buatlah code sesuai perintah berikut.\n",
    "1. Load and preview the data\n",
    "2. Check the shape of the data\n",
    "3. Check the data types\n",
    "4. Check for correlations\n",
    "5. Generate summary statistics for numerical data only\n",
    "6. Plot Histograms for all numerical columns\n",
    "7. Generate a box plot for age, dan number_transactions\n",
    "8. Generate a lineplot for date_joined to total_amount_usd\n",
    "9. Generate scatter plots comparing total_amount_usd to number_transaction\n",
    "10.Generate Horizontal bar charts for job\n",
    "11.Generate Horizontal bar charts for marital\n",
    "12.Generate a heatmap for future correlations\n",
    "13.Identify Missing Values"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "af689548",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "from sklearn.cluster import KMeans\n",
    "from sklearn.linear_model import LinearRegression\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import accuracy_score, r2_score\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split\n",
    "from sklearn.neighbors import KNeighborsClassifier\n",
    "\n",
    "# Pengaturan tampilan grafik\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style=\"whitegrid\")\n",
    "%matplotlib inline"
   ]
  },
  {
